                ("README.md", #"""
                # {{NAME}}

                A BASIC project. Open `{{NAME}}.basproj` in BASICStudio and press Run, or
                build it with `basicc`:

                ```sh
                make        # build and run
                make build  # just build, into Build/{{NAME}}
                ```

                The same source runs unchanged in the interpreter:

